<% content_for :title, "Your BonID Has Been Approved" %>

<h2 style="color: var(--palm-green); font-weight: 700;">BonID Approved</h2>

<div class="status-card" style="border-left-color: var(--palm-green); background: #f5fff9;">
  <strong>Status:</strong> Approved<br>
  Your digital BonID is now active and ready for use.
</div>

<p>Dear <strong><%= @submission.user.first_name %></strong>,</p>

<p>
  Congratulations. Your BonID verification has been successfully approved.
  You can now access your verified BonID QR code and use it for identity verification
  with trusted institutions such as banks, embassies, and law enforcement.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= citizens_identity_submissions_url %>" class="button">View My BonID</a>
</p>

<p>
  Thank you for completing your identity verification through BonID.
</p>

<p>BonID Verification Team</p>
